<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap');
  body{font-family:'Nunito','ABC Arizona Sans',Calibri,sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11pt;margin:0}
  .wrap{padding:26px 34px 30px}
  h1{font-family:'Nunito',Georgia,serif;color:#2f6df0;font-size:24pt;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 4px}
  h2{font-family:'Nunito',Georgia,serif;color:#2f6df0;font-size:15pt;font-weight:800;margin:18px 0 5px}
  p{margin:3px 0}.sub{color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11pt}.lbl{font-weight:800;color:#2f6df0;margin-top:8px}.bul{margin-left:20px}.ind{margin-left:14px}
  table.ft{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:6px 0;font-size:9.5pt}
  table.ft th{background:#2f6df0;color:#fff;border:1px solid #2f6df0;padding:4px 6px;text-align:left;font-size:9pt}
  table.ft td{border:1px solid #c9d4e2;padding:4px 6px}
  table.ft tr.tot td{background:#eef2fb;font-weight:700}
 </style></head><body><div class="wrap"><h1>Advice Request – David &amp; Lisa Hartmann</h1><p class="sub">Adviser: Hayden Wilson</p><p class="sub">(ACCUMULATOR SOA · Couple · Existing client)</p><div style="height:7px"></div><p>Hi Team,</p><p>David &amp; Lisa are existing clients. They want to retain their SMSF, cancel personal insurances, consolidate the car loan into the home loan, and switch the investment property loan to interest only.</p><div style="height:7px"></div><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>Risk Profile</h2><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>Scope of Advice</h2><p>1 · Debt Management</p><p>2 · Investment Property</p><p>3 · Investment Bond</p><p>4 · Investment Plan</p><p>5 · Personal Superannuation</p><p>6 · Superannuation Contributions</p><p>7 · Personal Protection</p><p>8 · Cashflow Management &amp; Budgeting</p><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>1 · Debt Management Advice</h2><p class="lbl">Strategy Recommendations</p><p class="bul">• Both: We recommend consolidating your existing car loan into your home loan.</p><p class="bul">• Both: We recommend you switch your investment property loan(s) from principal &amp; interest to interest only to improve cashflow and maintain tax-deductible debt.</p><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>5 · Personal Superannuation Advice</h2><p class="lbl">Strategy Recommendations</p><p class="bul">• Both: We recommend you retain your existing SMSF.</p><div style="height:7px"></div><h2>Advice Fees</h2><p>Commitment: —  ·  Ongoing: No changes</p><table class="ft"><tr><th></th><th>Up·Super</th><th>Up·Cash</th><th>Ong·Super</th><th>Ong·Cash</th><th>Their total p.a.</th></tr><tr><td>David</td><td></td><td></td><td>$2,400</td><td></td><td>$2,400</td></tr><tr><td>Lisa</td><td></td><td></td><td>$2,400</td><td></td><td>$2,400</td></tr><tr><td>Joint</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr class="tot"><td>Total</td><td></td><td></td><td>$4,800</td><td></td><td>$4,800</td></tr></table></div></body></html>